  "body": "issue : #6232  \r\n\r\nSummary of Changes:\r\n\r\nAdded form validation to ensure the total does not exceed 100.\r\nDetails:\r\nIn this commit, we added form validation to the existing HTML form to ensure that the calculated result does not exceed 100. When users input two numbers, we use JavaScript to calculate their sum and display the result in a new <output> element.\r\n\r\nValidation Steps:\r\n\r\nFork the original project and create a new branch.\r\nUse the provided HTML code or enter two numbers in the <input> elements and click the submit button.\r\nIf the sum of the input numbers is less than or equal to 100, the result will be displayed on the page.\r\nIf the sum of the input numbers is greater than 100, an alert will be shown, indicating that the result must not exceed 100.\r\n",
